    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doodle Knight</strong> is a charming 2D puzzle-platformer that puts the power of creativity in your hands! Play as a brave knight armed with not just a sword but a magical pen and pencil. Explore a whimsical, hand-drawn castle filled with traps,  and mind-bending puzzles that only your imagination can solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw platforms, bridges, and tools to overcome hazards, and unlock hidden paths. Every scribble matters\u2014solve puzzles your way, with endless possibilities at your fingertips. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your creativity be enough to defeat the challenges?\u00a0Grab your pen and get ready to <i>doodle</i> your way to victory!</p>",
